OL,3,AHannah Fry feels 'unbelievably lucky'
OL,4,Aafter cervical cancer treatment
OL,5,
OL,6,FProf Hannah Fry has described feeling
OL,7,F"unbelievably lucky" after being
OL,8,Ftreated for cervical cancer.
OL,10,FThe mathematician and BBC presenter,
OL,11,Fwho recently took part in the second
OL,12,Fseason of the Celebrity Traitors, said
OL,13,Fcancerous cells were discovered after
OL,14,Fshe attended a cervical screening in
OL,15,F2020.
OL,17,FShe underwent a hysterectomy,
OL,18,Fdescribing the experience to BBC Radio
OL,19,F4's Desert Island Discs as "horrific".
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,165,160,200,105,0,100
